          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP329 FCP [FOUND]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Yeah, this one definitely needed a sweep as far as my experience tonight went. But I did get it (and marked the location with a Starbucks cup.) Thanks!&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
